# The image is built from an allowlist: the Python package, its lockfile and the
# built web UI. Everything else in the checkout stays out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!rdst.py
!mcp_server.py
!_version.py
!_version_build.py
!features/
!shared/
!web_dist/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
